Adventurer,

In our latest *Dev Talk* , Game Director Robin Henkys introduces some of th=
e big changes coming to *open world play* with the next update in late Nove=
mber, affecting *mobs, treasure sites* , and much more.

Watch the Dev Talk here:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Db8Zdy9AFSic )

For a written summary, click here ( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-o=
pen-world-gameplay ).
---------------------------------------------------------------------------=
---------------------

Bob is Back
-----------

The nights are drawing in, there=E2=80=99s a chill in the air=E2=80=A6 yes,=
 *Allhallows* has returned to Albion! From *10:00 UTC on October 27* throug=
h to *10:00 UTC on November 10* you can run the Hallowed Ground dungeon by =
entering one of the special portals that appear randomly in T4-T8 zones acr=
oss the open world. Once inside you=E2=80=99ll find creepy corridors filled=
 with pumpkins, gruesome mobs, and the strange, terrifying final boss known=
 simply as *Bob.*

( https://albiononline.com/news/allhallows-2021 )

Both group and solo versions of the dungeons will appear, and each offer ra=
re seasonal loot like the Jack o' Donkey and Horse Macabre mount skins. And=
 as always, Halloween decorations will adorn each of Albion=E2=80=99s citie=
s to mark this eerie time.

So don your dungeon-delving kit, venture out into the dark night and rid Al=
bion of these malevolent spirits!

( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-biome-rework )

Albion Awakens
--------------

Next month's *Lands Awakened* update brings a complete rework of Albion's n=
atural world. For a preview of the beautiful new biome visuals and updated =
terrains and layouts, check out an earlier Dev Talk from our Game Director:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-biome-rework )

